sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant API as Export API
    participant Queue as Job queue
    participant Worker as Export worker
    participant Store as Result store
    User->>API: Request export
    API->>Queue: Enqueue job
    Queue-->>API: Accepted with job ID
    API-->>User: Job accepted (not complete)
    Queue->>Worker: Deliver job
    alt Export succeeds
        Worker->>Store: Save result
        Worker->>API: Record completed status + result ID
        Worker-->>Queue: Acknowledge job
    else Export fails
        Worker->>API: Record failed status
        Worker-->>Queue: Acknowledge terminal failure
    end
    User->>API: Get job status
    API-->>User: Status and result ID if complete
